cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TrustRAG: Trustworthy Retrieval-Augmented QA for Technical Documents"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end retrieval-augmented generation system for question answering
  over PDF documents, with citation-grounded generation, heuristic confidence
  scoring, abstention when evidence is weak, and a provider-agnostic LLM layer
  (Gemini, OpenAI, Ollama, offline mock).
